## Before Submitting Changes Checklist

1. ✅ Run `yarn quality` (verifies rules sync, formatting, linting, and tests)
2. ✅ Respect Workspace Facade: invoke all operations via `yarn <script>`
3. ✅ Never write directly under `data/` (use `packages/jobs-runtime/lib/db.js`)
4. ✅ Update relevant documentation and API schemas
5. ✅ Leave working tree unstaged — never `git commit` or `git push`
